      "content": "thanks, those points are a good start. but it feels a bit too much like a textbook lol. i need this for a video script, so it needs to be way more punchy and convincing. can u write these out as strong, definitive points that i can use to show why this parenting style is failing kids? make them sound like hard truths people need to hear.",
