      "content": "wow that's exactly the kind of energy i need for the video. it's so much more impactful when you put it that way. can u give me a few more examples of how this actually looks in real life? like, what are some specific behaviors or situations where gentle parenting definitely fails and shows why a more traditional, disciplined approach is better?",
